  "prefLabel": "Odb 203.10 Notice of Hearings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Odb 203.10 Notice of Hearings. When a hearing is scheduled, notice shall be provided in writing, to all parties or other interested persons, at least 15 days prior to the hearing date. The notice shall specify the date, time, place and subject matter of the hearing.\n\nSource. #8490-A, eff 11-22-05; ss by #12941, eff 12-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/odb100-600.html"
